d Digital Asset used in that way, a \\\"Secondary Pair Asset\\\"). A User-Generated Digital Asset that was launched against a Secondary Pair Asset, rather than against a Supported Pair Asset, may not itself be used as a paired asset. Whether a User-Generated Digital Asset is eligible to serve as a Secondary Pair Asset is determined by reference to the asset against which it was launched, and is not affected by the later removal of that asset from the Supported Pair Assets list. We may change the eligibility rules for Secondary Pair Assets, or withdraw the ability to launch against them, at any time and without notice.\"]}]\n21a:T404,A Secondary Pair Asset is a User-Generated Digital Asset created by a user of the Pump Platform. It is not a Supported Pair Asset, its creator is not a Pair Asset Issuer, and it has no Pair Asset Terms. The ability to launch against, price or trade a User-Generated Digital Asset as a Secondary Pair Asset results from the operation of the eligibility rules in paragraph (a) and not from any review, selection or approval by the Pump Entities, and does not constitute an endorsement, recommendation, solicitation or promotion of that Digital Asset or its creator, or a representation that it is suitable for you, has any particular value or liquidity, or is lawful to acquire or hold in your jurisdiction. The Pump Entities do not audit, verify or monitor any Secondary Pair Asset or its creator. Sections 20.1 and 25.1 apply to a Secondary Pair Asset as a User-Generated Digital Asset, and Sections 30A.3, 30A.5 and 30A.7 apply to it as if it were a Supported Pair Asset. Section 30A.4 does not apply to a Secondary Pair Asset.197:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white dark pl-6\",\"children\":[\"(b) \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"No review, selection or approval. \"}],\"$21a\"]}]\n21b:T641,You acknowledge and agree that: (i) the value of a User-Generated Digital Asset paired with a Secondary Pair Asset depends on the price and liquidity of the Secondary Pair Asset and, through it, on the Supported Pair Asset against which the Secondary Pair Asset was launched, so that a decline in value, loss of liquidity, abandonment by its creator, community takeover or other event affecting the Secondary Pair Asset or that Supported Pair Asset may result in the loss of some or all of the value of your Digital Assets even where the price of your Digital Asset relative to the Secondary Pair Asset is unchanged; (ii) a Secondary Pair Asset is a User-Generated Digital Asset created by another user, may have little or no liquidity, may be concentrated in a small number of Wallets, and is subject to all of the risks described in the Risk Warning; (iii) any price, market cap, graduation threshold or other value displayed on the Pump Platform in SOL, USDC or any other unit for a User-Generated Digital Asset paired with a Secondary Pair Asset is derived by reference to two or more pools or price sources, is indicative only, and may be delayed, inaccurate or stale; (iv) a Transaction in a User-Generated Digital Asset paired with a Secondary Pair Asset may be routed through more than one pool, and each leg of that route may incur fees, slippage and price impact; and (v) Creator Fees, Holder Rewards, and Cashback Rewards in respect of a User-Generated Digital Asset paired with a Secondary Pair Asset accrue in the Secondary Pair Asset, whose value may fluctuate and which may be illiquid.198:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white dark pl-6\",\"children\":[\"(c) \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Layered risk. \"}],\"$21b\"]}]\n199:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white dark pl-6\",\"children\":[\"(d) \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Events affecting a Secondary Pair Asset. \"}],\"If a Secondary Pair Asset is removed, hidden, restricted or otherwise made unavailable on the Pump Platform under Section 15, Section 20.2, the DMCA Policy or otherwise, it will cease to be available as a paired asset